        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 3910S-P, Century Sliding Pocket Door Passage Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Century Round Solid Brass Passage Pocket Door Set is great for contemporary homes. It is available in a wide array of popular finish choices including satin nickel, oil rubbed bronze and polished brass. This set comes packaged with everything you need for a pocket door: (2) <a href=\"/products/century-solid-brass-round-flush-pull-omnia-7503-52\">round flush pulls</a> and (1) <a href=\"/products/sliding-pocket-door-edge-pull-omnia-3917\">edge pull</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe finger edge pull is screwed into the door's edge so that you have something to grip in order to slide the door out of the pocket. The round flush pulls are pressure mounted into the door's face.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/century-round-privacy-pocket-door-mortise-lock-omnia-3910s\"><b>Century Privacy Pocket Door Lock</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/century-double-pocket-door-privacy-set-omnia-3910s-dd\"><b>Century Double Pocket Door Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 3910S-P Century Round Pocket Door Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>Solid Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Depth: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) round flush pulls and an edge pull. For One (1) Door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/made-usa-logo.jpg?v=1704354497\" width=\"515\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
